        <!-- ===== Notes ===== -->
        <mxCell id="notes" value="What changed vs current (addresses review findings):&#10;• 2 app nodes behind LB + DB replica → removes single-host / DB SPOF (F-3)&#10;• Redis split: sessions=noeviction, cache=allkeys-lru → no session eviction (F-2)&#10;• moodledata → S3/objectfs (shared) → enables multi-node scale-out (F-4)&#10;• Backups: nightly DB+files, offsite 3-2-1, tested restore (F-1)&#10;• Metrics + alerting on Redis mem / disk / DB / health (F-6)&#10;• Secrets in Vault / Docker secrets, not plaintext .env (F-5)&#10;• cron stays single-node (Moodle requires one scheduler)&#10;— solid: always-on   - - - dashed: control / backup / integration" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
